            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Release v5.8.4</h2>
<h3>Changes since v5.8.3</h3>
<ul>
<li>fix(ci): assert non-main-app build lines unchanged by md5, not by value</li>
<li>fix(ci): brace-quote NEW_BUILD_VERSION / OTHER_COUNT in Chinese echo strings</li>
<li>fix(ci): scope CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION bump to Lumi main app only</li>
<li>fix(ci): use awk instead of grep -c in build number assertions</li>
<li>refactor(AppStorePromoDesigner): remove preview/source mode toggle</li>
</ul>]]></description>
